<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alpha Beta downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alpha Beta downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Securities International Inc said Monday it downgraded to attractive from buy its recommendation of Alpha Beta Technology Inc based on less than expected results of phase three trials of its treatment for surgical infection.</p>
<p>Analyst Peter Drake said he expects Alpha Beta's stock will be under pressure today and will likely take some time to recover.</p>
<p>Shares of Alpha Beta were trading off 4-9/16 to 6-1/4 on turnover of more than 8.2 million shares.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
